{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02825","headline":"赠许左丞从驾万年宫 · 卢照邻","name":"赠许左丞从驾万年宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻道上之回，诏跸下蓬莱。\n中枢移北斗，左辖去南台。\n黄山闻凤笛，清跸侍龙媒。\n曳日朱旗卷，参云金障开。\n朝参五城柳，夕宴柏梁杯。\n汉畤光如月，秦祠听似雷。\n寂寂芸香阁，离思独悠哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02825.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02825","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}